Dataset: data.csv
Dataset is available under the data folder.

once uploaded, click run all.

for Single-item forecast u can update PREDICT_ITEM and PREDICT_DATE.

***notes to consider***
The trained dataset ends at 20/07/2025 so the next day would be 21/07/2025.
The model supports short term predcition in the range 7 days to max 30 days.
THe model suffers in accuracy as the PREDICT_DATE increases since the model it dependet on rolling_mean 
values tend to become a linear line with no variations.

Sample items u can try:
1. Starter,
2. R.G,
3. Branmix,
4. Wheat,
5. Barley.


